  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fingano S.A. and Vengano S.A.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IIC financing will be used to partially fund the installation, commissioning, and operation of a 90 MW wind farm in the Sierra de Carap&#xe9; mountains; the construction of a 150 kV, 39 km transmission line to connect the wind farm to the national electricity grid; and road work and other civil engineering works.Fingano S.A. and Vengano S.A. are special-purpose entities established to develop two wind farms&#x2014;jointly, &#x201c;Parque E&#xf3;lico Carap&#xe9;&#x201d;&#x2014;with a combined nominal output of 90 MW. The wind farms are located in the Sierra de las Ca&#xf1;as and Sierra de Carap&#xe9; mountain ranges in Maldonado Department, some 20 km south-southeast of the town of Aigu&#xe1;. The project includes a two-phase installation of 31 three-megawatt wind turbines.</narrative>
  </description>
